Output scene2.mp4
Source common.tape
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1616
Set Height 812
Set Framerate 30
Source setup.tape
Type "testdash"
Enter
Wait+Screen@300s /tests ready/
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 500ms
Down@200ms
Right@250ms
Down@200ms
Right@250ms
Down@200ms
Space@300ms
Down@200ms
Space@400ms
Down@150ms 3
Right@250ms
Space@400ms
Down@120ms 4
Right@300ms
Sleep 400ms
Type "g"
Sleep 800ms
Type "/"
Type@90ms "refund"
Sleep 1.1s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
